[' Here's a high-level outline of the Rust project structure and components for the build management system, followed by a C# function that parses an XML document using XPath. Note that this is a conceptual design, and the actual implementation will require extensive coding work.

**Rust Project Structure:**

```bash
build-management-system/
|-- src/
|   |-- build_manager/
