['1. Service Scheduling Algorithm (Using a priority queue for scheduling based on service priority):

```java
import java.util.PriorityQueue;
import java.time.Instant;

class ServiceScheduler {
    private PriorityQueue<Service> services = new PriorityQueue<>();

    void schedule(Service service) {
        if (!services.contains(service)) {
            services.add(service);
        }
    }

    Service nextService() {
        Instant currentTime = Instant.now();
        while (!services.isEmpty()) {
            Service service = services.poll();
            if (currentTime.minusMillis(service.getLastActive().toEpochMilli()).isAfter(service.getInterval())) {
                return service;
            }
        }
        return null;
    }
}
```

