- Graceful handling of service failures and retries with exponential backoff and circuit breaker patterns:

```java
import java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit;

class RetryStrategy {
    private int retryCount = 0;
    private long timeout = TimeUnit.SECONDS.toMillis(1); // initial timeout

    void reset() {
        retryCount = 0;
    }

    boolean tryAgain(long currentTime) {
        if (retryCount < MAX_RETRIES) {
            long elapsed = (currentTime - lastAttempt) / timeout;
            if ((Math.pow(2, elapsed)) >= MAX_TIMEOUTS) {
                return false; // circuit breaker opens
            }
            retryCount++;
        }
        reset(); // reset the strategy after a successful attempt
        return true;
    }
}
```

